example.code:
Dim malformed As String = "{name: 'Alice', age: 30,}"
Dim repaired As String = malformed.RepairJson()
' repaired = {"name":"Alice","age":30}

example.para:
The internal quotes around "HIF-1 induces GLUT1" and "PDK1" are followed
by letters/spaces, so they are kept. Only the final quote (followed by
} or ,) is treated as the closing quote.
